# Paths brandi should not lint about itself: files that intentionally
# quote prohibited-list example words as data, not as brand prose.
#
# src/genome.rs embeds the default prohibited.yaml template verbatim
# (including "awesome", "amazing", "game changer", ...) as documentation
# examples of what the rule catches, not as brand-facing copy.
src/genome.rs

# tui/brandi_test.go uses "amazing" as a literal fixture to unit-test the
# prohibited-term rule; it is not user-facing prose either.
tui/brandi_test.go
